Article 49
(1) Special protection for children in conflict with the law as referred to in Article 44 includes children in conflict with the law and child victims of criminal acts, and constitutes the obligation and responsibility of the Regional Government and society.
- 30 - (2) Special protection for children in conflict with the law as referred to in paragraph (1) shall be implemented through:
